<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX closes higher led by SPT Telecom.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX closes higher led by SPT Telecom.</headline>
<text>
<p>1300 GMT - The Czech RPIX closes higher as SPT Telecom picks up steam late in continuous session.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX up 6.5 points, 0.5 percent at 1,283.4</p>
<p>* Turnover, 24.1 million crowns</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom gains 50 crowns to 3,850</p>
<p>* RIF rises five crowns to 1,030</p>
<p>* CEZ rises nine crowns to 1,219</p>
<p>* Ceska Sporitelna rises three crowns to 323</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
